# Optional. The app works fully without this — the Ask concierge falls back
# to a deterministic templated sentence when it's unset, and all
# recommendation ranking always happens in application code regardless.
#
# Set this only if you want the concierge's intro sentence phrased by an AI
# model instead of the built-in template. Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
# and NEVER commit a real value to source control.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
